  spec: "[TSON-SCHEMA] §11.4"
  description: "The same rule at the scope §11.4 names first: the members of one enum. Worth its own vector because an enum member reaches a schema through the constructor's own vocabulary rather than through a declaration, so an implementation applying the mechanism where a name is read rather than where a scope is walked can miss exactly this position."
